Package: detqc
Title: Quality Control and Mortality Review for Telemetry Detections
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: c(
    person(c("Jacob", "W."), "Brownscombe", , "jakebrownscombe@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2496-8764")),
    person("Paul", "Bzonek", role = "ctb",
           comment = "example data from positionRtools")
  )
Description: Reads acoustic telemetry detections and receiver deployments from
    network and manufacturer exports into tables with fixed column names, checks
    them for data-entry errors, and applies the filters a user selects, logging
    every removed row with its reason. Candidate mortalities are flagged by
    rules and decided by a person on static review pages, and every step is
    recorded in a processing report.
